class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about imaginary situations in the present or future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can make negative conditionals by adding a negative word or negative auxiliary verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I wouldn't ask you over if I <span class=\"strong\">had nothing</span> to offer you.</span> <br/>or <br/><span class=\"italic\">I wouldn't ask you over if I <span class=\"strong\">didn't have anything</span> to offer you.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement </span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I had known earlier!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I didn't know earlier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wouldn't ask you over if I had nothing to offer you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I do have something to offer you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If I could, I would eat wherever you cooked every night of the week!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't eat where you cook every night\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I could tell you something good. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't tell you anything good\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Showing That You Understand Someone's Feelings", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a <span class=\"strong\">modal</span> like <span class=\"italic\">must</span> or <sapn class=\"italic\">can't</span> followed by an adjective when you want to empathize with someone. When you empathize with someone, you show them that you understand their situation or feelings.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "To talk about situations, use the <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> form of the adjective.<br/>To talk about feelings use the <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> form of the adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't forget to include the verb before the adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This must be what's left of the mouth-watering snacks!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can't be starving!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You must be excited to tell us all about your new dating prospects!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can't be interested in getting married!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put your feet up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to relax and rest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Come in, put your feet up and watch a movie!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk to old friends.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "a sight for sore eyes", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person or thing you are very happy too see", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:You two are a sight for sore eyes!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mouth-watering", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describing food that looks so good you want to eat it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Wow! Movies and mouth-watering snacks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shocked", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling great surprise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're hungry! I'm shocked!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "prospect", "type": "name"}, {"content": "possibility of something happening", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're excited to hear all about your new dating prospects!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "starving", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very hungry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter, you must be starving.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a letter to a friend in another city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use -ing adjectives to describe situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use -ing adjective to describe feelings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about wishes and hypothetical situations.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a letter to a best friend who has moved to another city for school or work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about how he/she must be feeling.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what the situation must be like for him/her.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the things you could do together if you were there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the things you would do together if he/she were still in your city.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le13ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter! You're here!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ladies. You two are a sight for sore eyes!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Come in. Put your feet up. We're so pleased you're here.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, Sal. What's been going on here? Girl's night in?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah. Movies and ..."}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "16500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This must be what's left of the mouth-watering snacks! Oh man. I wish I had known earlier! I would gladly eat anything if you made it V!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You - hungry! I'm shocked!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't look so worried. You can't be starving! There's lots more in the kitchen. I wouldn't ask you over if I had nothing to offer you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If I could, I would eat whatever you cooked every night of the week!"}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "41000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You must be excited to tell us all about your new dating prospects!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I could tell you something good. Not much luck finding a girlfriend I'm afraid.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, we're here for you. You can always count on us. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah. You guys are like family.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Besides, you're not ready to settle down yet, are you? You can't be interested in getting married and starting a family!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're right. I'm not really ready to commit quite yet."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le13ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about friendships and relationships.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can show I understand someone's feelings.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Who are the friends that you are closest to in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What things do you talk about when you're together?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How would you feel if they moved to another city?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "You must be hungry!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Peter is hungry? Sally says she's <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">shocked</span>!", "